<section class="standard" id="standard"><div class="wrap block">
  <div class="std-head">
    <div class="std-intro"><div class="eyebrow">The Organicopia standard</div><h2>How we decide what earns a place on your shelf.</h2><p>An introduction to the principles behind our sourcing and product decisions.</p></div>
    <div class="std-visual"><img src="/org/range.webp" alt="The Organicopia range: cacao powder, spices, seeds and extracts" width="1400" height="723" loading="lazy"/></div>
  </div>
  <div class="std-band">
    <div class="std-band-l"><div class="std-kicker">Beyond Organic. Beyond The Label.</div><h3>Organic is a starting point.<br/>Not the whole picture.</h3></div>
    <div class="std-band-r"><p>Organic certification matters, and we respect it. But it mostly describes how food is grown, not everything that happens afterward. Even certified organic products can contain highly processed ingredients, flavour enhancers and additives.</p><p>So we look beyond the label: the ingredients, how they are processed, and the overall quality of the finished product. Organic is a plus. Clean, honest and thoughtfully made is the standard.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="std-label"><span>Our four principles</span></div>
  <div class="std-principles">
    <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7S2 12 2 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2.5v1.5M5.2 4.8l1 1.1M18.8 4.8l-1 1.1"/></svg><h3>Transparency</h3><p>Origin, size and what is actually inside are printed on the card, not hidden in a footnote. Nothing to hide.</p></div>
    <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 21V11M12 11c0-4 3-6.5 7-6.5 0 4-3 6.5-7 6.5ZM12 14c0-3.5-2.5-5.5-6-5.5 0 3.5 2.5 5.5 6 5.5ZM7 21h10"/></svg><h3>Integrity</h3><p>Products are chosen because they belong in a healthy kitchen for years, not because they are this season's trend.</p></div>
    <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 11h18M4 11l1.6 9h12.8L20 11M8 11l2-6M16 11l-2-6M9.5 15v2M14.5 15v2"/></svg><h3>Accessibility</h3><p>Exceptional food should be within reach. Fair prices, honest sizes, and a discount when you stock up.</p></div>
    <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 21s-7-4.5-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 11c0 5.5-7 10-7 10Z"/></svg><h3>Care</h3><p>Every sourcing decision is made with families in mind. We serve people, not transactions.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="std-intent">
    <div><img src="/org/sticker-sourced.svg" alt="Sourced with Intention seal" width="124" height="86"/><div><h3>Sourced with Intention</h3><p>Carefully selected from trusted growers and producers abroad, checked for ingredients, processing and quality before we put our name on it.</p></div></div>
    <div><img src="/org/sticker-made.svg" alt="Made with Intention seal" width="124" height="86"/><div><h3>Made with Intention</h3><p>Made by us in Lebanon, in small batches: our clarified butter ghee and the fresh-from-the-oven bakes, from organic ingredients.</p></div></div>
