<section class="story" id="story">
  <img class="waves" src="/org/wavy-navy.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="filter:brightness(0) invert(1)"/>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Our story</div>
      <h2>A brand built around trust, not trends.</h2>
      <p class="big">Organicopia wasn't born because the world needed another organic food brand. It was born because buying healthy food shouldn't require becoming an investigator.</p>
      <p>We grew out of Soul Mind Body Foods, a Lebanese family business that has spent years importing and distributing certified organic ingredients to shops, cafés and kitchens across the country. Standing between the world's best growers and Lebanese homes, we kept hearing the same question from mothers and family cooks: "Can I trust this?"</p>
      <p>Organicopia is our answer. Every ingredient is sourced with intention. Every product is selected because it deserves a place in someone's home, not because it follows the latest wellness fad. Our ghee and our bakes are made by hand in small batches; everything else is chosen from producers we have verified ourselves, with the origin printed right on the card.</p>
      <p>Because we aren't really selling spices, cacao or superfoods. We are curating peace of mind: the quiet confidence to fill your kitchen without hesitation, and to reconnect with the natural rhythm of life.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="side">
      <div class="panel seal"><img class="seal-img" src="/org/logo-mark.svg" alt="Organicopia tree mark"/></div>
      <div class="panel"><h3>Our philosophy</h3><p>Beyond organic. Beyond the label. Thoughtfully sourced. We value organic certification, but we never assume a product is clean just because it carries a label. We look at how it is made, what goes into it, and the quality behind every ingredient, and we only list what we can stand behind.</p></div>
      <div class="panel"><h3>Part of the Soul Mind Body Foods family</h3><p>Our parent company supplies organic ingredients to businesses across Lebanon and believes a healthier world starts with pure ingredients. <a href="https://www.smbfoods-lb.com/#story" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read their story →</a></p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

